Deikhan Changes
- Renamed all advanced discs so they don't conflict with cleric
- Removed cleric wrath spells (rain brimstone etc.)
- Moved around some skills to match up with the new discs
- Divine Rescue: Advanced form of rescue that heals the target
- 2h specialization: Additional damage with 2h weapons
- Divine Grace: Resistence to some afflictions
- Guardian's light: Protection proc while using a shield
- Removed kick
- Smite is reworked: less damage but usable more often
Includes a +hit buff -protection debuff so it isn't advised
to use it while tanking
- Changed deikhan sword sanc proc to Holy Wrath (+hit buff)
This makes it no longer conflict with spell sanctuary
- Deikhan Auras : Buffs that affect a deikhans entire group when in
the same room. See help aura
